    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "When used as a contextual type, a union type U has those members that are present in any of ",
      "start": 38,
      "end": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " its constituent types, with types that are unions of the respective members in the constituent types. ",
      "start": 134,
      "end": 239
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Let S be the set of types in U that have call signatures.",
      "start": 243,
      "end": 303
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " If S is not empty and the sets of call signatures of the types in S are identical ignoring return types,",
      "start": 305,
      "end": 412
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " U has the same set of call signatures, but with return types that are unions of the return types of the respective call signatures from each type in S.",
      "start": 414,
      "end": 568
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " With no call signature | callSignatures",
      "start": 918,
      "end": 960
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " With call signatures with different return type",
      "start": 1037,
      "end": 1087
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Like iWithCallSignatures",
      "start": 1161,
      "end": 1188
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Like iWithCallSignatures2",
